{"content_hash": "660410098ed67400", "version_id": 784, "article_id": 79, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Kane wins Ballon d'Or as Putellas takes third title", "title_zh": "凯恩首夺金球奖，普特利亚斯第三次捧杯", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "guardian_sport", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/football/live/2026/oct/26/ballon-dor-2026-updates-from-70th-edition-in-london-live", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1711234186672-00cfb626ea33?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8YmFsbG9uJTIwaGFycnl8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MzA2MTcyMnww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Rob Griffin on Unsplash", "author": "Rob Griffin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@rgartprjkt?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-person-holding-a-red-balloon-with-a-picture-on-it-gwdbwUC-mLU?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(214, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(252, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "131ee3a62343"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-27", "word_count": 231, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "Harry Kane has won the men's Ballon d'Or for the first time, becoming the first Englishman to take the prize in 25 years. Alexia Putellas won the women's award for the third time at the ceremony in London.", "lead_zh": "哈里·凯恩首次获得男子金球奖，成为25年来首位获此殊荣的英格兰球员。亚历克西娅·普特利亚斯在伦敦举行的颁奖典礼上第三次捧起女子金球奖。", "preview": "Kane, who plays for Bayern Munich and England, was crowned at the ceremony on Monday 26 October 2026. The striker had an extraordinary seaso", "preview_zh": "效力于拜仁慕尼黑和英格兰队的凯恩，于2026年10月26日（周一）的颁奖典礼上加冕。这位前锋度过了一个非凡的赛季，在68场比赛中打进77球。他在获奖感言中感谢了家人，并表示自己的道路并不平坦。他告诉年轻人，只要努力，一切皆有可能，哪怕无人注视的时候。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 767, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 76.825, "size_bytes": 461952, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 260, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 78.45, "size_bytes": 471600, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 260, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/79/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 83.65, "size_bytes": 502848, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 260, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/79/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 72.55, "size_bytes": 436320, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 260, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/79/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 77.35, "size_bytes": 465120, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 260, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/79/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@220942b/content/data/versions/784.json", "paragraphs": ["Kane, who plays for Bayern Munich and England, was crowned at the ceremony on Monday 26 October 2026. The striker had an extraordinary season, scoring 77 goals in 68 appearances. In his speech, he thanked his family and said his journey had not been straightforward. He told young people that anything is possible with hard work, even when no one else is watching.", "Putellas, who plays for Barcelona and Spain, won the women's award for the third time. Barcelona was named women's club of the year for the third time in four years, while Paris Saint-Germain took the men's club prize for the second year in a row. Luis de la Fuente of Spain was named men's coach of the year.", "Several other prizes were handed out during the evening. Kane was also named men's striker of the year, and Charlyn Corral of Mexico won the women's striker award. Lamine Yamal won men's young talent for the third year running, and Vicky Lopez took the women's prize for the second time. Bukayo Saka received the Socrates award for his charity work.", "Kane also thanked his wife Kate, calling her his biggest supporter, and his children, who he said were the reason he plays. He paid tribute to his parents, who travelled around the world to watch him without ever pressuring him, and to his brother Charlie, who is also his agent."], "paragraphs_zh": ["效力于拜仁慕尼黑和英格兰队的凯恩，于2026年10月26日（周一）的颁奖典礼上加冕。这位前锋度过了一个非凡的赛季，在68场比赛中打进77球。他在获奖感言中感谢了家人，并表示自己的道路并不平坦。他告诉年轻人，只要努力，一切皆有可能，哪怕无人注视的时候。", "效力于巴塞罗那和西班牙队的普特利亚斯第三次获得女子金球奖。巴塞罗那队四年内第三次当选年度最佳女足俱乐部，巴黎圣日耳曼则连续第二年获得最佳男足俱乐部奖。西班牙队的路易斯·德拉富恩特当选年度最佳男足教练。", "当晚还颁发了其他多个奖项。凯恩同时当选年度最佳男足前锋，墨西哥的查琳·科拉尔获得最佳女足前锋奖。拉明·亚马尔连续第三年获得最佳男足新秀，维姬·洛佩斯第二次拿下最佳女足新秀。布卡约·萨卡因慈善工作获得苏格拉底奖。", "凯恩还感谢了妻子凯特，称她是自己最大的支持者，并提到了孩子们，说他们是自己踢球的原因。他致敬了父母，他们走遍世界看他比赛，却从不给他压力，也感谢了哥哥查理，他同时也是自己的经纪人。"], "body": "Kane, who plays for Bayern Munich and England, was crowned at the ceremony on Monday 26 October 2026. The striker had an extraordinary season, scoring 77 goals in 68 appearances. In his speech, he thanked his family and said his journey had not been straightforward. He told young people that anything is possible with hard work, even when no one else is watching.\n\nPutellas, who plays for Barcelona and Spain, won the women's award for the third time. Barcelona was named women's club of the year for the third time in four years, while Paris Saint-Germain took the men's club prize for the second year in a row. Luis de la Fuente of Spain was named men's coach of the year.\n\nSeveral other prizes were handed out during the evening. Kane was also named men's striker of the year, and Charlyn Corral of Mexico won the women's striker award. Lamine Yamal won men's young talent for the third year running, and Vicky Lopez took the women's prize for the second time. Bukayo Saka received the Socrates award for his charity work.\n\nKane also thanked his wife Kate, calling her his biggest supporter, and his children, who he said were the reason he plays. He paid tribute to his parents, who travelled around the world to watch him without ever pressuring him, and to his brother Charlie, who is also his agent.", "body_zh": "效力于拜仁慕尼黑和英格兰队的凯恩，于2026年10月26日（周一）的颁奖典礼上加冕。这位前锋度过了一个非凡的赛季，在68场比赛中打进77球。他在获奖感言中感谢了家人，并表示自己的道路并不平坦。他告诉年轻人，只要努力，一切皆有可能，哪怕无人注视的时候。\n\n效力于巴塞罗那和西班牙队的普特利亚斯第三次获得女子金球奖。巴塞罗那队四年内第三次当选年度最佳女足俱乐部，巴黎圣日耳曼则连续第二年获得最佳男足俱乐部奖。西班牙队的路易斯·德拉富恩特当选年度最佳男足教练。\n\n当晚还颁发了其他多个奖项。凯恩同时当选年度最佳男足前锋，墨西哥的查琳·科拉尔获得最佳女足前锋奖。拉明·亚马尔连续第三年获得最佳男足新秀，维姬·洛佩斯第二次拿下最佳女足新秀。布卡约·萨卡因慈善工作获得苏格拉底奖。\n\n凯恩还感谢了妻子凯特，称她是自己最大的支持者，并提到了孩子们，说他们是自己踢球的原因。他致敬了父母，他们走遍世界看他比赛，却从不给他压力，也感谢了哥哥查理，他同时也是自己的经纪人。", "text": "Kane, who plays for Bayern Munich and England, was crowned at the ceremony on Monday 26 October 2026. The striker had an extraordinary season, scoring 77 goals in 68 appearances. In his speech, he thanked his family and said his journey had not been straightforward. He told young people that anything is possible with hard work, even when no one else is watching. Putellas, who plays for Barcelona and Spain, won the women's award for the third time. Barcelona was named women's club of the year for the third time in four years, while Paris Saint-Germain took the men's club prize for the second year in a row. Luis de la Fuente of Spain was named men's coach of the year. Several other prizes were handed out during the evening. Kane was also named men's striker of the year, and Charlyn Corral of Mexico won the women's striker award. Lamine Yamal won men's young talent for the third year running, and Vicky Lopez took the women's prize for the second time. Bukayo Saka received the Socrates award for his charity work. Kane also thanked his wife Kate, calling her his biggest supporter, and his children, who he said were the reason he plays. He paid tribute to his parents, who travelled around the world to watch him without ever pressuring him, and to his brother Charlie, who is also his agent.", "vocab": [{"word": "crowned", "pos": "verb", "zh": "加冕；被授予", "note": "常用于体育报道，表示获得最高荣誉", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "extraordinary", "pos": "adj", "zh": "非凡的；出色的", "note": "比 very good 更正式、更有力", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "appearance", "pos": "noun", "zh": "出场（次数）", "note": "体育语境中指上场比赛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "straightforward", "pos": "adj", "zh": "顺利的；简单的", "note": "常用于否定句，表示“并不容易”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tribute", "pos": "noun", "zh": "致敬；敬意", "note": "pay tribute to 表示向某人致敬", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "charity", "pos": "noun", "zh": "慈善；慈善机构", "note": "charity work 指慈善工作", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "prize", "pos": "noun", "zh": "奖项；奖品", "note": "与 award 意思接近，可替换使用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "supporter", "pos": "noun", "zh": "支持者；拥护者", "note": "既可指球迷，也可指支持自己的人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pressure", "pos": "verb", "zh": "施压；迫使", "note": "pressure someone to do something", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "in a row", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "连续地", "note": "for the second year in a row 连续第二年", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hand out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "分发；颁发", "note": "hand out prizes 颁发奖项", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ceremony", "pos": "noun", "zh": "典礼；仪式", "note": "award ceremony 颁奖典礼", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-27T00:42:00.481318", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Kane", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.725, "sm": 275, "em": 725, "cs": 0, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": ",", "s": 0.725, "e": 0.8, "sm": 725, "em": 799, "cs": 4, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "who", "s": 0.